## 八、SIMD指令映射

### 8.1 Ascend SIMD指令

DVM虚拟机将字节码指令映射到Ascend SIMD指令：

```cpp
// Ascend SIMD指令示例
__aicore__ void vadd(half *dst, half *src0, half *src1, uint64_t num) {
  for (uint64_t i = 0; i < num; i += SIMD_WIDTH) {
    // 使用Ascend向量指令
    __asm__ volatile (
      "vadd.half %0, %1, %2\n"
      : "=v"(dst[i])
      : "v"(src0[i]), "v"(src1[i])
    );
  }
}

__aicore__ void vmul(half *dst, half *src0, half *src1, uint64_t num) {
  for (uint64_t i = 0; i < num; i += SIMD_WIDTH) {
    __asm__ volatile (
      "vmul.half %0, %1, %2\n"
      : "=v"(dst[i])
      : "v"(src0[i]), "v"(src1[i])
    );
  }
}
```

